/target
/.claude/
# The store stays out of the source (DEPLOY-5): tickets live in the tracker's
# database, never here; a local plans/ is the owner's, untracked.
/plans/
# The Leptos app (frontend/) is its own cargo unit; build products only —
# its Cargo.lock IS committed (it's an application, not a library).
/frontend/target
/frontend/dist
# The magnitude ladder (perf/, PERF-3) is a Node package: dependencies and
# scratch output stay out; its lockfile IS committed.
/perf/node_modules
/perf/out
# The diagrams service's Node program (COMPILE-4): `npm ci --prefix
# diagrams/node` installs jsdom from the committed lockfile.
/diagrams/node/node_modules
# Python bytecode from scripts/ helpers.
__pycache__/
